TTX MDR/MVSEC ep20 calibration: resume checkpoint_epoch20 with optimizer/scaler state, reset LR from config via SDFORMER_MDR_RESET_LR_FROM_CONFIG=1, fixed low LR about 0.25x main train, run epochs 21-25 and validate at epoch25. Intended to recover the small +5.30% AEE gap without extending late-epoch overfit.